      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `embed_text.py` file that generates an embedding vector for one text string using a concrete external provider, I will choose Amazon Bedrock as the provider. Amazon Bedrock is a managed service that provides access to foundation models from leading AI companies, including Amazon. I will use the `bedrock-client` Python SDK to interact with the service. The code will include the import of the `bedrock-client` and a call to the specific model to generate the embedding. </thinking>\n",
